(   If an isolated graph has zero external references, it is swept and freed.) Tj
T*
(   3. Promotion: Objects surviving collection are promoted to older generations, which are scanned) Tj
T*
(   less frequently, optimizing CPU overhead.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
