T*
(   Analysis:) Tj
T*
(   In C, an `int` occupies strictly 4 bytes on stack memory. In CPython, an integer occupies 28) Tj
T*
(   bytes because it is a full `PyLongObject` containing reference counts and virtual machine) Tj
T*
(   dispatch pointers.) Tj
